{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「寰亞孻女」黃淑蔓（Feanna）新歌《餓》MV昨晚上架，她親自擔任MV導演，特別採用大熱「吃播」形式拍攝，一鏡到底，大玩新意！身為ASMR（自主感官經絡反應）超級粉絲，Feanna表示雖然MV無法收錄真正的ASMR咀嚼聲感可惜，但今次能親自執導並以吃播上陣也算另類如願。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565173918732288685942.jpeg/zc5ps6djqWKgaG2g5faPnwwRrdTgOpCTBr8aEga_GhI\"/><p>新歌《餓》由樂隊Dear Jane的結他手Howie作曲、黃偉文Wyman填詞、Howie與黃兆銘編曲、Howie與關禮琛監製，多位音樂人攜手打造，充滿Bandsound風格。Feanna透露Wyman因為知道她平時非常喜歡吃，加上本身帶點「戀愛腦」的特質，度身訂造了這份歌詞。Feanna說：「Wyman話，食嘢同愛情其實好相似，兩者都係一種渴望。但愛情同食嘢都係有限度，過量的話就會變成壞事，既傷身又傷心。」</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565230072074240413598.jpeg/4ZK1ucC3-ANFF4cq-NoMFbjjE8ZP6KtyqYHgramB4K0\"/><p>Feanna坦言最初曾一度猶豫，擔心自己好不容易減肥成功後，拍全場狂食的畫面會有矛盾，一番掙扎後她想通，最重要是表達歌詞的意思。「今次MV用『一鏡到底』嘅方式拍攝，但因為我減肥後食量其實細咗好多，本來預計拍攝時食三次就夠，點知拍完第三次之後，覺得有更好嘅呈現方式，所以決定加拍第四次，拍到一半頂唔住，真係好飽，證明『凡事有限度』呢個道理真係冇講錯！」</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565275907428352319586.jpeg/YZtPGZ0oO-u-_qcfmlAMUpvL4UcPQUR6pn8noqZ_J6I\"/><p>有所不知，原來Feanna不但人靚聲甜，而且天生「食宵夜去水腫」獨特體質，全場嘩然。她認真地說：「我研究過自己嘅體質，發現深夜收工食消夜，第二朝竟然完全唔會水腫。本來應該好開心，但諗深一層又有啲唔開心喎，因為依家為咗去水腫迫自己食宵夜，原本食宵夜嘅罪惡感冇晒囉！」</p><p>隨著新歌《餓》MV火熱登場，Feanna亦密鑼緊鼓地投入11月舉行的首個個人專場演唱會《蔓蔓蔓蔓蔓蔓Echoes of Man》籌備工作，希望以最佳狀態與Fans見面。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565402093457408796015.jpeg/QozU5cY5r5VpS8MH4bOdm7sFZcHRvEmsArtgVAK7YFQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565399606104064065748.jpeg/E1E-dKqZ5u6iX_hk8lRK4Y_Gvufm2mOIK4xGrCuMRqw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565396716097536863042.jpeg/B3qQlcIrO9I1Y_VtTu9iAWHnyRCWzABiLmn2Ei5p9hI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565393951920128081972.jpeg/latJXWT0tAQrEbRbaF7HkMZ9diVIodHio1ekO6NXpDs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565405147041792475683.jpeg/LejB-sxR3Cu256a1wjC9vH1uMGX4OjriiskT24rJE9s\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565402546442240058412.jpeg/LrWyCntM8Kl200Zn1OgHuP3-FYY0vFAyOjdOmjo3Tpo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565400155557888296017.jpeg/m84RoKLRxC_MT8AgZEOFWHOb3kOoJhAjFlSbOxZUmzs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565397357826048062749.jpeg/BeKGVc0Dy4YXvUm6Qjj9CYheNoBf3dGW5V0-8OVdPvA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565394476208128358096.jpeg/wCUjZrsAT6aDubLtajcnE41i4jQNyK4KkSXwCZEl8Ak\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565405373534208453197.jpeg/7ohLQIvUaZO_QC1reC0k9SOkE41vgoUOoxpQWKMaUFg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565402944901120536092.jpeg/vUxoabmupPp80e_jV9vbmklydvPRmRtuzZKA9c2SgPU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565400293969920839670.jpeg/aZ1N_KtWtebx7Uf8kcyn6qrnuje9gyx07LpHLey6Ry0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565397701758976732601.jpeg/tBBKOC4DfKclk8GzzfpXDuf1f8LGym8UMw1E5DMNROQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565394589454336064237.jpeg/V1ANKeoOFGtRDUHhBSAZAbqDfPRkup0UXqkFK16pBSs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565404979269632437169.jpeg/fVJ_-yEG7kqDusjzDvneD7mGimAQpDWV_hXLXf4Vy10\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565402449973248354127.jpeg/D62TzOOGeASB3wMt9Dh5da2L4s6OeVrg7iSad-4kmnc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565399706767360856423.jpeg/5umHNkUzuJKMmEhCUx9fsFDzQdDlw69JQoF6DEKBegw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565397085196288859234.jpeg/19zN1caMMnDMhvJZSTchWPmPTzcxRE1_MYcb8DGHG_A\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185565394421682176897320.jpeg/I26rwwCW3rGmZ9Yumb4Gn47MtVX7H-jvfXlal315Wpc\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T08:20:16.713265+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":737,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}